{"last_link_id": 746, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["# Qwen Image 2.1 · 单图/双图/多图总控\n\n## 使用方法\n\n1. **图1固定为编辑目标**，始终启用。\n2. 顶部红色控制台中，每个按钮对应一张参考图。\n3. 所有参考图默认关闭：此时就是单图编辑。\n4. 打开“参考图2”：变成双图编辑；继续打开即可变成多图编辑。\n5. 提示词中使用 `<image1>`、`<image2>`……明确每张图的职责。\n\n不要打开没有选择有效图片的参考图开关。\n\n## 官方参数\n\n- Steps：40-50\n- CFG：1\n- Sampler：Euler\n- Scheduler：Simple\n- Negative Prompt：空\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "快速使用", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [450, 650], "pos": [0, 570], "id": 463, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["# 官方模型结构树\n\n```text\nComfyUI/\n└── models/\n    ├── diffusion_models/\n    │   ├── qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors\n    │   └── qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors\n    ├── text_encoders/\n    │   ├── qwen3vl_8b_bf16.safetensors\n    │   ├── qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n    │   └── qwen3vl_8b_w4a8.safetensors\n    └── vae/\n        └── qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors\n```\n\n模型仓库：\n\n- https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1\n\n当前工作流默认选择BF16扩散模型＋BF16文本编码器；观众可按显存直接在绿色子图中切换官方INT8或W4A8权重，其他节点无需修改。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "官方模型结构树", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [450, 530], "pos": [0, 0], "id": 476, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#263342", "widgets_values": ["# custom_size 与像素说明\n\n## custom_size 关闭\n\n- 最终画布跟随 **图1** 的尺寸与宽高比。\n- 宽高会对齐到 32 的倍数。\n- 下方“分辨率选择器”不参与最终尺寸。\n\n## custom_size 开启\n\n- 最终画布由“分辨率选择器”的 **比例＋像素量** 决定。\n- 建议选择接近图1的宽高比，否则编辑内容可能发生位移或重新构图。\n\n## 像素量是什么\n\n这里的 MP 是**宽×高的总像素预算**，不是单边长度：\n\n- 1MP、1:1 ≈ `1024 × 1024`\n- 1MP、4:3 ≈ `1184 × 896`\n- 1MP、3:2 ≈ `1248 × 832`\n- 1MP、16:9 ≈ `1376 × 768`\n\n由于宽高按 32 对齐，实际总像素会与目标 MP 略有差异。\n\n补充：子图里的 `resolution = 0` 控制的是参考图编码尺寸，表示尽量保持原图；如果指定分辨率如1280直接填写即可。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "尺寸说明 · custom_size / 像素", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#111827", "size": [450, 590], "pos": [2.62456723021387e-13, 1282.08544921875], "id": 491, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#fff0", "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "type": "Label (rgthree)", "title": "作者：B站-是古手梨花sama", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#fff0", "size": [3746, 300], "pos": [787.24267578125, -965.1766357421875], "id": 492, "properties": {"padding": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fontFamily": "Arial", "borderRadius": 0, "textAlign": "left", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "angle": 0, "fontSize": 300, "fontColor": "#3CB371"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "positive", "links": [722], "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "negative", "links": [723], "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "negative"}, {"name": "latent", "links": [], "label": "latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent"}], "size": [210, 446], "pos": [1963.1480712890625, 323.4259338378906], "widgets_values": ["多格分镜构图，分割面板排版，斜切分格，倾斜面板，非对称分格，，禁止黑白配色。中文。对话框内容简单直白。禁止出现台词以外的文字。无水印。古风，玄幻，中式修仙，这是**国产古风仙侠漫画（manhua）风格**画风上属于日漫式赛璐璐上色 + 中式仙侠题材的混合风格。\n\n**风格特征：**\n- 多格分镜漫画布局，带对话气泡。\n- 韩系/日系精致人物立绘脸型，赛璐璐硬阴影上色。\n- 仙侠元素：\n- 高饱和戏剧化配色。", "", 0], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 721, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images.image_1", "link": 704, "label": "参考图 1 (Image-1)", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "参考图 1 (Image-1)"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "link": 720, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 746, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "negative_prompt"}, "name": "negative_prompt", "label": "negative_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "negati